abstract: "Public code, audit ledgers and computational evidence for a computer-assisted argument that HG_P(C5)=4. The historical full local audit checked all actual inputs and replayed 8,613 terminal certificates and 66,403,934 RUP additions. No external human peer review or proof-assistant certification is claimed."
